<p><strong><em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VVPiR6lb_C8">There's a starman waiting in the sky</a><br />
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VVPiR6lb_C8">He'd like to come and meet us</a><br />
