<hr />
<p>I really should have done more to this (Hippo pointed out a number of problems and flaws with it which I should have addressed more closely), but at a certain point you just get burnt out on a skip and need to post. I ended up feeling no desire to do any more to this. I imagine this won't do amazingly, but I'll at least see if there are people who enjoy it.</p>
