<p>Oh, and anyone who's thinking of downvoting on principle because of my shameless abuse of Scranton Reality stuff/the ridiculous physics, there's a very specific reason for such lunacy, so read to the end. It's not just laziness.</p>
<p>This skip also contains references to 2669 and 2747. If the authors of either of these pieces would like me to remove the references, I will happily do so.</p>
<p>Oh, and all credit to NineVolt to finding the picture.</p>
