<p>What you're not understanding is that&#8230;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Show&nbsp;whatever</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
