<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>The Foundation isn't consciously sending exploration teams to this thing. They never actually created the &quot;Scranton Reality Drives&quot; or &quot;Scranton Reality Cannons&quot; for use with this thing.</p>
<p>The reality warping pre-teen (accidentally) created those as part of his narrative about the Space Station. One day, the Foundation woke up, and this entire fleet of Scranton Reality Drive ships and cannons were just suddenly there, complete with crews and a backstory and everything. And the Foundation slowly started to realize they weren't there all along, they weren't supposed to be there, they had been reality-warped in.</p>
<p>The hook is: how does the reality warping YA writer know about the Foundation and Scranton technology?</p>
